      "side": 1,
      "message": "1) You\u0027d make a change to MODULE.bazel similar to what you have:\n```\nbazel_dep(name \u003d \"local_skrifa\") # notice no version\n\nlocal_path_override(\n    module_name \u003d \"local_skrifa\",\n    path \u003d \"/path/to/local/skrifa\",\n)\n\n```\n\nThen, in `/path/to/local/skrifa`, you\u0027d add a MODULE.bazel file that loads `rules_rust`. See https://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/984976/36/include/config/MODULE.bazel for an example\n\nLike your other CL, you\u0027d then change the deps from `\"@crates//:skrifa\"` -\u003e `\"@local_skrifa\"`\n\n2) We can also try making the Cargo.toml file the source of truth. If you want to give that a shot https://bazelbuild.github.io/rules_rust/crate_universe_bzlmod.html#cargo-workspaces after this lands (since you are a bit more familiar with Cargo things than I am), I\u0027m happy to review and support.",
